+---
+other:
+  - |
+    Chaining retry conditions with ``|`` or ``&`` now builds one ``retry_any``
+    or ``retry_all`` holding all the conditions, instead of nesting one inside
+    the other. The sync and async strategies behave the same, and the combined
+    condition's result does not change.
